<template><main class="kit-detail-page"><div class="page-shell kit-breadcrumb"><RouterLink to="/">홈</RouterLink><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i><RouterLink to="/products/kits">키트 상품</RouterLink><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i><span>{{kit.kitName||'상세'}}</span></div><div v-if="isLoading" class="kit-detail-layout page-shell kit-detail-loading"><span></span><div><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div v-else-if="loadError" class="community-empty"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation"></i><h2>키트 정보를 불러오지 못했습니다.</h2><button @click="loadKit">다시 불러오기</button></div><template v-else><section class="kit-detail-layout page-shell"><div class="kit-detail-image"><span v-if="!isStockAvailable" class="sold-badge">SOLD OUT</span><img :src="kit.imagePath||'/img/defalut_product.png'" :alt="kit.kitName" /></div><div class="kit-detail-info"><p class="eyebrow">KARINABEL CURATED KIT</p><h1>{{kit.kitName}}</h1><p class="kit-detail-sub">좋은 향을 더 편리하고 특별하게 만나는 큐레이션 키트</p><div class="kit-price"><div v-if="kit.originalPrice"><span>구성 상품 정상가</span><del>{{formatPrice(kit.originalPrice)}}원</del></div><div><span>회원 키트가</span><strong>{{formatPrice(kit.memberPrice)}}원</strong></div><p v-if="savingAmount>0"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> 개별 구매보다 {{formatPrice(savingAmount)}}원 할인</p></div><div class="kit-delivery"><dl><div><dt>구성</dt><dd>에센셜 오일 {{kit.products?.length||0}}종</dd></div><div><dt>배송</dt><dd>택배 배송 · 결제 시 안내</dd></div><div><dt>재고</dt><dd :class="{danger:!isStockAvailable}">{{isStockAvailable?'구매 가능':'구성품 재고 부족'}}</dd></div></dl></div><div class="kit-quantity"><span>수량</span><div><button :disabled="quantity<=1" @click="quantity--"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i></button><strong>{{quantity}}</strong><button :disabled="!canIncrease" @click="quantity++"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button></div></div><div class="kit-total"><span>총 상품금액</span><strong>{{formatPrice(totalPrice)}}원</strong></div><div :class="['kit-buy',{disabled:!isStockAvailable}]"><Winpay :product="kit" :quantity="quantity" :userInfo="user" :disabled="!isStockAvailable" orderType="kit" /></div><p class="external-note">현재 카드결제 선택 시 제휴 쇼핑몰로 이동합니다.</p></div></section><section class="kit-composition"><div class="page-shell"><header><p class="eyebrow">WHAT'S INSIDE</p><h2>키트 구성 상품</h2><p>키트에 포함된 에센셜 오일을 확인해 보세요.</p></header><div class="composition-grid"><article v-for="item in kit.products" :key="item.productInfo?._id||item.productId"><div><img :src="item.productInfo?.imagePath||'/img/defalut_product.png'" :alt="item.productInfo?.koreanName||'구성 상품'" /></div><span>ESSENTIAL OIL</span><h3>{{item.productInfo?.koreanName||'에센셜 오일'}}</h3><p>{{item.quantity}}개 · {{item.productInfo?.volume||0}}ml</p><small :class="{danger:(item.productInfo?.stock||0)<item.quantity}">재고 {{item.productInfo?.stock||0}}개</small></article></div></div></section><section class="kit-use-guide page-shell"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>구성 확인</h3><p>키트에 포함된 오일과 수량을 확인하세요.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>향기 경험</h3><p>각 오일의 개성을 하나씩 천천히 경험하세요.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>나만의 조합</h3><p>취향에 맞게 블렌딩하며 새로운 향을 발견하세요.</p></div></article></section></template></main></template>
<script setup>import{computed,onMounted,ref}from"vue";import{useRoute}from"vue-router";import ProductService from"@/api/ProductService.js";import Winpay from"@/components/payment/Winpay.vue";const route=useRoute(),kit=ref({products:[]}),quantity=ref(1),isLoading=ref(true),loadError=ref(false),user=ref(JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("user")||"null"));const isStockAvailable=computed(()=>(kit.value.products||[]).length>0&&kit.value.products.every(item=>(item.productInfo?.stock||0)>=item.quantity*quantity.value));const canIncrease=computed(()=>(kit.value.products||[]).every(item=>(item.productInfo?.stock||0)>=item.quantity*(quantity.value+1)));const totalPrice=computed(()=>Number(kit.value.memberPrice||0)*quantity.value);const savingAmount=computed(()=>Math.max(0,Number(kit.value.originalPrice||0)-Number(kit.value.memberPrice||0)));const formatPrice=value=>Number(value||0).toLocaleString("ko-KR");const loadKit=async()=>{isLoading.value=true;loadError.value=false;try{kit.value=(await ProductService.getKit(route.params.id,localStorage.getItem("token"))).data}catch(error){console.error(error);loadError.value=true}finally{isLoading.value=false}};onMounted(loadKit);</script>
<style>.kit-detail-page{background:#fff}.kit-breadcrumb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding-top:27px;color:#9d9398;font-size:.66rem}.kit-breadcrumb i{font-size:.45rem}.kit-detail-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:clamp(50px,7vw,95px);padding-block:42px 105px}.kit-detail-image{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1.03;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#f7f4f1}.kit-detail-image img{width:90%;height:90%;object-fit:contain}.kit-detail-info{padding-top:22px}.kit-detail-info h1{margin:13px 0 7px;font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.6vw,3.5rem);font-weight:400}.kit-detail-sub{padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line);color:#93898e;font-size:.72rem}.kit-price{padding:23px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line)}.kit-price>div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin:6px 0}.kit-price span{color:#7f757a;font-size:.74rem}.kit-price del{color:#a89ea3;font-size:.8rem}.kit-price strong{color:var(--color-brand-dark);font-size:1.5rem}.kit-price>p{margin-top:11px;color:#9d6670;font-size:.65rem}.kit-price>p i{margin-right:5px}.kit-delivery{padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line)}.kit-delivery dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;padding:5px 0;font-size:.7rem}.kit-delivery dt{color:#a0979b}.kit-quantity{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 0}.kit-quantity>span{font-size:.75rem}.kit-quantity>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px 42px 36px;height:36px;border:1px solid var(--color-line)}.kit-quantity button{border:0;background:#fff;font-size:.6rem}.kit-quantity strong{display:grid;place-items:center;border-inline:1px solid var(--color-line);font-size:.72rem}.kit-total{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:19px;background:var(--color-warm)}.kit-total span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700}.kit-total strong{color:var(--color-brand-dark);font-size:1.45rem}.kit-buy{margin-top:12px}.kit-buy.disabled{opacity:.45;pointer-events:none}.kit-buy :deep(.buyProductButton){width:100%}.kit-composition{padding:95px 0;background:var(--color-warm)}.kit-composition header{text-align:center}.kit-composition h2{margin:10px 0 5px;font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:400}.kit-composition header>p:last-child{color:#92888d;font-size:.72rem}.composition-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:45px}.composition-grid article{padding:14px 14px 20px;background:#fff}.composition-grid article>div{aspect-ratio:1;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#f8f6f4}.composition-grid img{width:90%;height:90%;object-fit:contain}.composition-grid article>span{display:block;margin-top:13px;color:#a59ba0;font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.09em}.composition-grid h3{margin-top:3px;font-size:.82rem}.composition-grid p,.composition-grid small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#8e8489;font-size:.62rem}.danger{color:#b35f69!important}.kit-use-guide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding-block:65px}.kit-use-guide article{display:flex;gap:15px;padding:10px 35px;border-right:1px solid var(--color-line)}.kit-use-guide article:last-child{border:0}.kit-use-guide>article>span{color:var(--color-accent);font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:.7rem}.kit-use-guide h3{font-size:.78rem}.kit-use-guide p{margin-top:3px;color:#91878c;font-size:.64rem}.kit-detail-loading>span,.kit-detail-loading>div{height:580px;background:#f4f1ef}.kit-detail-loading>div{padding:50px;background:#fff}.kit-detail-loading i{display:block;width:80%;height:20px;margin-bottom:25px;background:#f4f1ef}@media(max-width:850px){.kit-detail-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.composition-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.kit-use-guide{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kit-use-guide article{padding:20px 5px;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line)}}@media(max-width:550px){.kit-detail-layout{padding-bottom:70px}.kit-detail-info{padding-top:0}.kit-composition{padding-block:70px}.composition-grid{gap:10px}.composition-grid article{padding:8px 8px 15px}}
</style>
